# Trivy suppressions. Use SPARINGLY and always with a justification + review date.
# The point of this project is to FIX findings, not ignore them — this file is
# here to show the process for the rare unfixable/accepted case.
#
# Example (commented; nothing is actually suppressed):
# CVE-2024-XXXXX  # no fix available upstream; not reachable in our usage; review 2026-Q4
